        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WB100, 1 Inch Small Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 1 inch round flush wall mounted door bumper (door stop) is made of solid brass and available in 8 great finishes. Easy to install with the included hardware. The small door stop is very inconspicuous with concealed screw mounting for a clean and contemporary look. It can be used in everything from homes to hotels on all types of doors, including shower doors. By mounting the door stop on the wall and centering it where the door knob makes contact, you can protect both the wall and the door knob and reduce door slamming.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WB100-specifications.gif?v=1704354607\" width=\"298\" height=\"167\" border=\"0\" atl=\"1 Inch Small Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana WB100 1 Inch Door Bumper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Housing Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WB100.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  WB100 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1 Inch Small Wall Bumper,",
                "description": "1 Inch Small Door Stop, Deltana WB100 - This 1 inch round flush wall mounted door bumper (door stop) is made of solid brass and available in 8 great finishes. Easy to install with the included hardware. The small door stop is very inconspicuous with concealed screw mounting for a clean and contemporary look. It can be used in everything from homes to hotels on all types of doors, including shower doors. By mounting the door stop on the wall and centering it where the door knob makes contact, you can protect both the wall and the door knob and reduce door slamming.",
